---
---

<section class="pillars section" id="pillars">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="pillars-header">
      <span class="section-label animate-in" data-i18n="pillars.label">The Foundation</span>
      <h2 class="animate-in" data-i18n="pillars.title">
        Four pillars.<br/>One complete system.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="pillars-grid">
      <div class="pillar-item animate-in" style="transition-delay: 0.05s">
        <div class="pillar-accent" style="background: var(--strength)"></div>
        <div class="pillar-content">
          <h3 class="pillar-name" data-i18n="pillars.strength.title">Strength</h3>
          <p class="pillar-desc" data-i18n="pillars.strength.desc">
            Build muscle, protect your joints, support bone density. 90–120 minutes per week — that's the sweet spot research confirms for long-term health.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pillar-item animate-in" style="transition-delay: 0.15s">
        <div class="pillar-accent" style="background: var(--endurance)"></div>
        <div class="pillar-content">
          <h3 class="pillar-name" data-i18n="pillars.endurance.title">Endurance</h3>
          <p class="pillar-desc" data-i18n="pillars.endurance.desc">
            Heart health, mental clarity, energy that lasts. Running, cycling, swimming — find your rhythm and take it outside with local groups.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pillar-item animate-in" style="transition-delay: 0.25s">
        <div class="pillar-accent" style="background: var(--mobility)"></div>
        <div class="pillar-content">
          <h3 class="pillar-name" data-i18n="pillars.mobility.title">Mobility</h3>
          <p class="pillar-desc" data-i18n="pillars.mobility.desc">
            Move freely. Yoga, stretching, functional mobility — the sessions your body asks for when everything feels tight.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pillar-item animate-in" style="transition-delay: 0.35s">
        <div class="pillar-accent" style="background: var(--recovery)"></div>
        <div class="pillar-content">
          <h3 class="pillar-name" data-i18n="pillars.recovery.title">Recovery</h3>
          <p class="pillar-desc" data-i18n="pillars.recovery.desc">
            Rest is training. Breathing exercises, gentle movement, and intentional rest days — guided by how your body actually recovers.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .pillars {
    background: var(--ivory);
  }

  .pillars-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
    max-width: 500px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .pillars-header h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .pillars-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  .pillar-item {
    position: relative;
    padding: var(--space-lg) var(--space-md);
    background: var(--white);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    border: 1px solid var(--divider);
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: transform var(--duration-base) var(--ease-out),
                box-shadow var(--duration-base) var(--ease-out);
  }

  .pillar-item:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  }

  .pillar-accent {
    width: 32px;
    height: 3px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .pillar-name {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .pillar-desc {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  /* ─── Responsive ─── */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .pillars-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .pillars-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .pillar-item {
      padding: var(--space-md);
    }
  }
</style>
